+ * [9]  VDEC1 Reset mdec's PIC_DC
+ * [10] VDEC1 Reset mdec's Pscale
+ * [11] VDEC1 Reset vcpu's MCPU
+ * [12] VDEC1 Reset vcpu's CCPU
